Package: corsair-lncore-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: DKMS module for Corsair Lighting Node Core
 This package provides the kernel module for controlling
 Corsair Lighting Node Core RGB via a /dev device file.

Package: corsair-lncore-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Command-line tool for Corsair Lighting Node Core
 This package provides a command-line tool (cln-cli) for easy
 control of Corsair Lighting Node Core RGB LEDs without
 programming knowledge.
